  lines:
  - english: I see more Error Dust near the lake. Many forgotten words gather there.
    vietnamese: "Ch\xFA th\u1EA5y nhi\u1EC1u B\u1EE5i L\u1ED7i quanh h\u1ED3. H\xECnh
      nh\u01B0 nh\u1EEFng t\u1EEB b\u1ECB qu\xEAn \u0111ang t\u1EE5 v\u1EC1 \u0111\xF3."
  - english: Do not rush. Use a bush or a trap when you need a break.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng v\u1ED9i. H\xE3y d\xF9ng b\u1EE5i c\xE2y ho\u1EB7c
      b\u1EABy khi c\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3ng ngh\u1EC9."
